{"id":"32070d51-e122-499b-a21d-493ccedcc065","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:43:00.633Z","batchId":"settings_claude-sonnet-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-sonnet-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div>\n    <h1>Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, choose how we contact you, and control who can see your information.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"tablist\" id=\"tabs\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-tab=\"notifications\">Notifications</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-tab=\"privacy\">Privacy</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section id=\"profile\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-panel>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Profile</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">This information appears on your public profile.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\">MR</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div><strong>Maya Rodriguez</strong> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Pro plan</span></div>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Member since March 2021 · JPG or PNG, max 2 MB</span>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Upload photo</button><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Remove</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>First name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Maya\"></label>\n        <label>Last name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Rodriguez\"></label>\n        <label>Email address<input type=\"email\" value=\"maya.rodriguez@example.com\"><span class=\"small up\">Verified</span></label>\n        <label>Username<input type=\"text\" value=\"mayar\"></label>\n        <label>Time zone\n          <select><option>Pacific Time (UTC−8)</option><option>Mountain Time (UTC−7)</option><option>Eastern Time (UTC−5)</option><option>UTC</option></select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Language\n          <select><option>English</option><option>Español</option><option>Français</option></select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label>Bio<textarea rows=\"3\">Product designer focused on accessible interfaces. Currently building design systems for small teams.</textarea><span class=\"small muted\">Up to 200 characters.</span></label>\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Discard changes</button>\n        <button class=\"btn\">Save profile</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Danger zone</div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Deleting your account permanently removes your projects and data. This cannot be undone.</p>\n      <div><button class=\"btn btn-destructive btn-sm\">Delete account</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"notifications\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-panel hidden>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Notification preferences</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose what you hear about and where.</p>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"table\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Activity</th><th>Email</th><th>Push</th><th>SMS</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>Comments and mentions</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">When someone replies to or tags you</span></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Project updates</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Status changes on projects you follow</span></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Security alerts</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">New sign-ins and password changes</span></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Billing and invoices</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Receipts and failed payments</span></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\" checked></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><input type=\"checkbox\"></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <label>Weekly digest\n        <select><option>Monday morning</option><option>Friday afternoon</option><option>Off</option></select>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Product news and tips</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Pause notifications outside 8am–8pm</label>\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Security alerts can't be fully disabled.</span>\n        <button class=\"btn\">Save preferences</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"privacy\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-panel hidden>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Privacy</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Control your visibility and how your data is used.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label>Profile visibility\n        <select><option>Public – anyone can view</option><option selected>Team only</option><option>Private – only me</option></select>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show my email address to teammates</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Show my online status</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Allow search engines to index my profile</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Share anonymous usage data to help improve the product</label>\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Changes apply immediately after saving.</span>\n        <button class=\"btn\">Save privacy settings</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Your data and security</div>\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <div><strong>Two-factor authentication</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Authenticator app enabled</span></div>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Enabled</span>\n      </div>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <div><strong>Download your data</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Get an archive of your profile and activity. Usually ready within 24 hours.</span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Request export</button>\n      </div>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <div><strong>Active sessions</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">3 devices signed in · last activity today</span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Sign out others</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('#tabs [data-tab]').forEach(function(b){\n  b.addEventListener('click',function(){\n    document.querySelectorAll('#tabs [data-tab]').forEach(function(x){x.classList.add('btn-outline')});\n    b.classList.remove('btn-outline');\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]').forEach(function(p){p.hidden = p.id !== b.dataset.tab});\n  });\n});\n</script>","deltas":[[754,"<div class=\"page st"],[1012,"ack g"],[1015,"ap-lg\">\n  <"],[1015,"div>"],[1015,"\n    <h1>"],[1015,"Account sett"],[1015,"ings</h1>\n    <"],[1015,"p class=\"lead\">Man"],[1031,"age your profile, cho"],[1066,"ose how we"],[1098," cont"],[1135,"act you, and control"],[1166," who"],[1278," can see your information"],[1278,".</p>\n  </div"],[1279,">\n\n  <div class=\"row"],[1313," g"],[1349,"ap-sm\" role"],[1386,"=\"tablist\" id"],[1418,"=\"t"],[1465,"abs\">\n    <button class"],[1504,"=\"btn btn-s"],[1535,"m\" data-tab=\"prof"],[1571,"ile\">Profile</button>"],[1604,"\n    <button class=\"btn"],[1641," btn-sm btn-"],[1678,"outline\" data-tab=\""],[1718,"notifications\">Notifications"],[1748,"</button>\n    <button class"],[1784,"=\"btn btn-sm"],[1821," btn-outline\" data-"],[1863,"tab=\"privacy\">"],[1895,"Privacy</button>\n  "],[1930,"</div>\n\n  <section id"],[1966,"=\"profile\" class=\"st"],[2005,"ack g"],[2034,"ap-lg\""],[2072," data-pan"],[2107,"el>\n    <div class=\""],[2141,"card st"],[2177,"ack\">\n      <div>"],[2213,"\n        <div"],[2248," class=\"card-title\">Prof"],[2285,"ile</div>\n        <p"],[2320," class=\"card-desc\">This"],[2356," information"],[2393," app"],[2428,"ears on your public profile.</"],[2469,"p>\n      </div>"],[2498,"\n      <div class=\"row g"],[2534,"ap-lg\">\n        <"],[2572,"div class=\"avatar\">"],[2608,"MR</div>\n        <"],[2649,"div class=\"stack g"],[2680,"ap-sm\">\n          <"],[2714,"div><"],[2754,"strong>Maya R"],[2795,"odriguez</strong>"],[2822," <span class=\"badge badge"],[2862,"-secondary\">P"],[2893,"ro plan</span></div>"],[2928,"\n          <span class=\"small mu"],[2965,"ted\">Member since March"],[3003," 2021 · JPG"],[3041," or PNG, max"],[3080," 2 MB</span>"],[3107,"\n          <div class=\"row g"],[3146,"ap-sm\"><button class"],[3184,"=\"btn btn-sm"],[3215," btn-outline\">Up"],[3252,"load photo</button><button class"],[3293,"=\"btn btn-sm"],[3322," btn-ghost\">"]